{"parse": {"title": "小径/再见，来亚什基/劳动食堂", "pageid": 106682, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小径</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8A.B3.E5.8A.A8.E9.A3.9F.E5.A0.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"劳动食堂\">劳动食堂</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 劳动食堂</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_zhigongshitang\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_zhigongshitang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在仔细查看过庆祝会的菜单，确认过食物的储量之后，教师坐在了最近的一把椅子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>日程太过紧张，稍后她还要赶去参加演出彩排，只能趁着这点儿间隙稍作休息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同样忙碌的厨师带着清单离开了，现在也并不是用餐时间，食堂相当安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸开胳膊，借用膝盖支撑起乐器，试图缓解压在肩头的疲倦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>最开始买下你的时候，西蒙诺夫同志还说手风琴可不好学……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>难携带，又难打理。结果我还是偏要把你带到这儿来，和那些绘画工具一块儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我就知道总能派上用场的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琴键轻巧地落下，就像她过去伸手分开水流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这首歌曾被用于欢迎访客。现在，它将被用于歌唱小镇的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“失去的昨日令我们遗憾——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“但更美好的仍旧在前方——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>好像调子高了些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>休息时间并不会持续太久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>抱歉，维拉女士。我是来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-307814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-307814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-307814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>维拉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-307810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-307810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-307810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我知道你在食堂，因为你早上跟乌里扬娜说过！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切发生得太快，教师只来得及将手风琴放到脚边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眨眼的工夫，向日葵和一团毛绒绒的小东西就一起扎进了维拉怀里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>阿夫西维同学？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-307810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-307810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-307810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>嘿嘿～今天好，维拉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>呃……非常抱歉。我刚离开教室就给逮住了。阿夫西维同学说他也有事找您，我想，也不能让他一个人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>还是说回正事吧，维拉女士，我和同事预计明天离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>明天？这实在有些匆忙……你们上次问起的理线学学者，北方哨歌同志，还一直在附近的矿区忙活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-308712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-308712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-308712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我想她大概来不及抽出时间……庆祝会也还在筹备中，我原本预计那时候介绍她和你们认识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离别的讯息让孩子抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>噢，你要走了吗？乌里扬娜回来了，你还会回来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>当然……只是暂时处理其他事务，我们会按协商好的时间再次造访。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>说好的神秘学培训，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>是的，就像乌里扬娜，坐上移动的房子，去来亚什基外面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩煞有介事地点头，向日葵也跟着他一块儿摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我明白了。祝你们顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>感谢您的理解，维拉女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>基金会比来亚什基更大吗？那里也有向日葵和石头，也有“阿夫西维”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……很遗憾，这些都没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>但是会有很多你没见过的东西，小阿夫西维。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你可以记下它们，回来之后讲给大家听，也可以选择多待一阵子……这些都随你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>那为什么是我们过去，不是基金会搬来这里？来亚什基更好，这儿有我，也有维拉和妈妈，还有雪人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个简单，且难以回答的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>——等你们都被接到那儿，基金会就有“阿夫西维”了。维拉女士也可以随时拜访。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>而且，阿夫西维，你从妈妈那儿学到了怎么堆漂亮、结实的雪人，对吗？在基金会，你也可以和大家一块儿堆雪人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>那……维拉，你会去看我们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>等小镇上的事情处理完，我立刻就过来，不会让大家等很久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>说好啦。我去找彼得森同志，再见，维拉！再见，浣熊先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的身影迅速消失在了门口，步伐轻快，似乎一个天大的难题已经得到解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两位成年人不约而同地松了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>或许来亚什基的确比基金会更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>哈哈，我不会反驳你。对生活在这里的同志们而言，自己亲手建成的东西当然是最好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>没想到从其他地方来的大家也会这样想。基金会对你来说，不像来亚什基之于我们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>并不是。我只是在路过列宁格勒的时候，错误地推开了一扇恰好开着的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>大概不会有第二个来亚什基，它变化这样快，显而易见地将越来越好，值得一直存在下去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>它会一直存在下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>而且，只要有人到访过这儿，就总有人会在别处建起同样的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这也是我们同意送孩子们去基金会的原因之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>很高兴听到您这样说，维拉女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>时候不早了，我也先不打扰您了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>好的，再会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人的身影也消失在雪地里，桌椅旁只剩下独自思索的教师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——来亚什基会一直存在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>来到这里的同志翻开冰雪，撬起岩石，在冻土上打下一个小小的点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>为这个点取名“来亚什基”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>有许多双手在这里彼此紧握，有人前来，有人离去，与我们分享着，或分享过同样的理想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>即使它被雪覆盖，被占据，被摧毁……我们还是会把它重新造出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>是的，我们——会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她握紧拳头，轻轻挥了两下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不会比穿过洋流更为轻松，也不会比逃脱同族的追杀更艰难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光线从食堂的窗户落进来，映亮桌面，令鲁萨尔卡手臂上的鳞片也折射出光彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雪会一直落下，道路会一直延伸，走在其中的每个人都尽力地将脚步踏坚实，好留下痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离彩排开始还有一小段时间，足够她再喘口气，理清思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“时光呀它缓缓地飘远——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“朋友呀别为那不停留的怀念——”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小径/再见，来亚什基/劳动食堂"}}